cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "NarraCare: A Safety-Aware Narrative Recommender for 60-Day Rehabilitation"
abstract: >
  NarraCare is a 5-component pipeline — Expected-Utility simulator,
  contextual-bandit recommender (SAPS novel + 6 baselines), 56-rule
  Safety Agent, 3-Act Narrator, Reward Composer — evaluated over a
  60-day × 20-user protocol. SAPS Pareto-dominates LinUCB on both
  Infeasible Exploration Rate and Cumulative Reward.
authors:
